OL,3,AWoman, 80, set on fire outside own
OL,4,Ahome, say police
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 80-year-old woman is believed to
OL,7,Fhave been set on fire outside her home
OL,8,Fby a suspect using a flammable
OL,9,Faccelerant, police have said.
OL,11,FOfficers were called at about 12:45 GMT
OL,12,Fon Monday to reports the victim was
OL,13,Ffound in a first-floor communal area in
OL,14,FCaractacus Cottage View in Watford.
OL,16,FDetectives have since named her as
OL,17,FBrenda Raymond, who is in hospital with
OL,18,Flife-threatening injuries and remains
OL,19,Fin a critical condition.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
