OL,3,AWoman, 80, set on fire outside own
OL,4,Ahome, say police
OL,5,
OL,6,F"An accelerant may have been used
OL,7,Fbefore she was deliberately set on
OL,8,Ffire," said Hertfordshire Police, which
OL,9,Fis treating the incident as an
OL,10,Fattempted murder.
